{
  "hooks": {
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Edit|Write|NotebookEdit|Bash",
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/dispatcher/dispatch.ts\"", "timeout": 600 }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Write|Edit",
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/dispatcher/dispatch.ts\"", "timeout": 120 }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/dispatcher/dispatch.ts\"", "timeout": 600 }
        ]
      },
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "prompt",
            "timeout": 30,
            "prompt": "ask-don't-dump-issues checker was triggered!!\n\nHook input JSON: $ARGUMENTS\n\nRead last_assistant_message. It is the agent's final reply of this turn.\n\nJudge: does the reply leave any of these on the user without using AskUserQuestion?\n- issues\n- open decisions\n- open TaskList items\n- asked a question (?) (and gave choices)\n- wrote \"say the word\"-style items\n- wrote \"not checked\" or similar prose\nExamples of a dropped issue:\n- \"Task #20 is still open.\"\n- \"Not checked: the context-exit warning\"\n- \"The editor still shows hints. They are only hints.\"\n\nIf yes, answer {\"ok\": false, \"reason\": \"<quote the sentence or sentences>. Use AskUserQuestion to resolve them now.\"}\nIf no, answer {\"ok\": true}."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SubagentStop": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/dispatcher/dispatch.ts\"", "timeout": 600 }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/dispatcher/dispatch.ts\"", "timeout": 120 }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SessionEnd": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/dispatcher/dispatch.ts\"", "timeout": 120 }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "StopFailure": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/dispatcher/dispatch.ts\"", "timeout": 120 }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "UserPromptSubmit": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/dispatcher/dispatch.ts\"", "timeout": 120 }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
